# Windows checks out with core.autocrlf on by default and oxfmt wants LF, so a
# CRLF working tree fails format:check on all 69 files at once rather than on a
# real difference. That is what the one Windows job hit. LF everywhere, so the
# job reports the platform-specific lines it exists for and nothing else.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.apkg binary
*.png binary
